al; record these dependencies explicitly. Do not expand those existing abilities' source bindings silently. Development must first bind a versioned exterior representation to this actual source and specimen, consistent with its conserved existing identity and state. Source-specific representation and observation mechanisms must be implemented and validated before they can yield findings; neither Lin's anatomy nor the source plant's circle radius is specimen evidence. Any newly introduced modeling assumptions must be identified as assumptions, not prior observations or biological facts. Unsupported properties remain unknown. Smallest executable action is gentle viewing/reorientation plus a bounded report, without opening. Personal learning costs one active round and 0.2 energy; inspection costs one active round and 0.5 energy, no consumable material. No tool or support is required for gentle viewing of an accessible carried specimen. If not carried, require actual local access and existing handling permissions; do not treat an old inventory coordinate as current remote accessibility or supply free travel. Validate identity, ownership, whole/unreserved status, reach, implementation support and energy before charging. Execute the inspection as one atomic work unit with commit-time revalidation; no partial paid progress, escrow or persistent lock. Precommit interruption, cancellation or death produces no inspection debit or completed report; committed work is nonrefundable and repeat inspection requires new payment. Learning progress uses ordinary individual paid-study handling, retains completed units across interruption and gives no refund for completed study; registration grants neither study completion nor mastery. At commit record observation tick, exact source/item/model revision, method, actual observable-state fingerprint, evidence references, and per-property observed/unavailable status with uncertainty. Exterior shape, covering, visible condition and approximate dimensions may be reported only where implemented direct viewing supports them; dimensions use world-distance resolution 0.02 and uncertainty at least 0.01, not an invented physical-unit conversion. Do not disclose numerical decay as a visible symptom. Record whether an actually represented visible opening permits any view; unseen interior remains unknown. With no nominated tool or support, report that controlled destructive access has not been assessed or authorized. A possible stone-and-support method can be identified as a separate development/assessment dependency, not a proven method for this source. Any future opening requires an explicit separate decision and source-appropriate contact/conservation implementation with actual independently acquired tool and support. Do not press, strike, pry, sample, smell-challenge, taste or ingest. Preserve quantity, material, identity, ownership, location and physical condition; reorientation alone does not create fragments or contents. Ordinary ageing continues, without restoration. Output only a private dated report and observable inspection event, not food, shell, kernel, safety certificate or a world marker. No ongoing process, automatic inspection, maintenance benefit or upkeep is introduced. Reports remain dated snapshots; later changes require paid reinspection. Review/development waiting itself advances no world time. Implement established checks, accounting and deduplication in code rather than repeated model review. Other participants supply no answer, consent, action or knowledge unless they independently communicate and act.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":1,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"Assess experience independently of functional completion and visuals. Requests, development, naming, study, mastery, report creation, repeated color, and restated implementation limits earn zero. A genuinely new supported exterior observation or an actual informative physical observation failure may qualify only under the existing grounded-understanding rule if implemented and applicable personally to Moss: short gain 0.8, source cap 1, duration 8 rounds, cooldown 12 rounds; maintained gain 0.035 with decay 0.0015 per round. Deduplicate by specimen lineage, property and observed-state fingerprint across equivalent abilities. Missing mechanisms or unsupported findings yield no experience. Unchanged repeated inspections under this minimal version provide no automatic practice benefit. No nutrition, health, energy recovery or comfort is awarded; physical comfort remains capped at 10 and mood cannot reduce basic nutrition needs. Never alter protected reward accounts, budgets, goals or permissions.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Reuse the existing item rendering and observation-event/report components. Supply reusable metadata containing actor, specimen/source IDs, event ID, tick, model revision, method, progress state, evidence availability and uncertainty. A brief viewing/reorientation indication is allowed only during actual paid execution; report completion appears only after successful commit. Unsupported geometry is not rendered as established anatomy, and the source plant's graphics are not specimen measurements. Pending, interrupted, invalid and failed actions show their actual status, never an opened specimen or successful finding. Detailed measurements and report contents remain private unless Moss independently communicates them. Visuals create no material, access, safety inference or experience award.\\\"}]}\"}","logprobs":[]}

